sWO5yGhvppHRKm-7mQ","review_id":"e7HtMWzCSJhrDn0l77882w","date":"2012-04-21T13:18:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9193498492240906,"text_excerpt":"We came back here twice for the crab sandwich they had on special...yum! We really enjoyed sitting outside watching the hustle and bustle of the nearby French Market and had some nice cocktails. The service was good and the Maitre D' , David, attentive and effective...we stopped and ate at his suggestion! We had also been recommended this place by our family members who live in NOLA. They are always right!"},{"business_id":"voAosWO5yGhvppHRKm-7mQ","review_id":"7Eubzyi2QY2wwTs_kkVKyw","date":"2010-09-15T14:39:03","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9021399021148682,"text_excerpt":"On a recent trip to NOLA we stopped in at Magnolia Grill for lunch. The setting was like a diner. We choose to sit at the bar so we could watch the kitchen run, something I like to do when given the opportunity. The chef made conversation with us as he cooked and asked us about the food after we dug in. We actually ate here twice on our 4 day trip. The first time I had the muffaletta and he had the Ruben. Both were great. Jon's favorite dish the entire trip was actually the Ruben. While there eating our sandwiches, I saw them prepare some French toast. I had to come back from breakfast another day for breakfast. So we did. I had the French toast breakfast that came with eggs and 2 meats. ..."},{"business_id":"voAosWO5yGhvppHRKm-7mQ","review_id":"TenZvBEf6i75sJlAAfIOrA","date":"2011-12-17T19:19:11","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.901290237903595,"text_excerpt":"Popped into this place right off the market and it was sooooo entertaining!!! The one guy was constantly raggin' on everyone of the employees there, it was nice to see them talk smack back once in awhile. I had the turkey burger and sweet potato fries which were delicious!!! My sister had the seafood gumbo which was spicey goodness. This place was great!!!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"voAosWO5yGhvppHRKm-7mQ","photo_id":"i1vwWmDDwHtLndkUV0i_EA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/i1vwWmDDwHtLndkUV0i_EA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.90290367603302},{"business_id":"voAosWO5yGhvppHRKm-7mQ","photo_id":"TXbNTANnMyW3hOLUPcIRdQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/TXbNTANnMyW3hOLUPcIRdQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9029034972190857}]},"notebook_case":null}
